            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300453341996_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300453341996_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300453341996_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/match1867458date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">晋级16强！巴西2-1绝杀日本 马丁内利95分钟绝杀卡塞米罗头球破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867458_1782760281_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867458_1782760281_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867458_1782760281_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>佐野海舟贴地斩首开记录，卡塞米罗头球扳平，马丁内利补时95分钟绝杀。最终巴西2-1绝杀日本晋级世界杯16强，1/8决赛将对阵科特迪瓦与挪威之间的胜者，日本队史世界杯淘汰赛仍0胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/match1867446date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆冷！德国点球遭巴拉圭淘汰 德国3人失点巴拉圭将战法国瑞典胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867446_1782775968_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867446_1782775968_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260630/zhanbao_image_1867446_1782775968_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>哈弗茨、沃尔特马德、塔失点，德国队以总比分4-5不敌巴拉圭队被淘汰出局，巴拉圭队将在1/8决赛对阵法国和瑞典的胜者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42fa7395b0fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德国vs巴拉圭点球大战全过程：哈弗茨、沃尔特马德、塔失点</a></p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a419c183add4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">淘汰日本！巴西挺进世界杯16强 7月6日04:00战科特迪瓦/挪威胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c97ede087.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c97ede087.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c97ede087.jpg"> </div><p>巴西2-1绝杀淘汰日本，桑巴军团挺进世界杯1/8决赛，将面对科特迪瓦和挪威之间的胜者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a4297bec31a3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">5战全败！日本再度折戟淘汰赛首战，5次参加世界杯淘汰赛仍0胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c69e6690b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c69e6690b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c69e6690b.jpg"> </div><p>日本1-2遭巴西绝杀，再度止步世界杯淘汰赛首战，他们至今仍未尝过世界杯淘汰赛胜利的滋味。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42f00ea3709native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">前两届小组都没出线！德国遭巴拉圭淘汰，连续三届无缘世界杯16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a4300d3d503b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a4300d3d503b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a4300d3d503b.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，德国负于巴拉圭，无缘世界杯16强，连续三届世界杯止步32强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42ef16abc14native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆冷淘汰德国！巴拉圭晋级世界杯16强，将战法国vs瑞典胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a430042c7db6_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a430042c7db6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a430042c7db6.jpg"> </div><p>巴拉圭点球大战淘汰德国，成功晋级世界杯16强，他们1/8决赛的对手将是法国与瑞典之间的胜者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c15b85d07native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还是做不到！日本连续三届世界杯淘汰赛先进球，但都遭逆转出局</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b9e6c526b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b9e6c526b_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b9e6c526b_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛，日本1-2遭巴西绝杀，连续三届世界杯淘汰赛被逆转。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42be6c59b80native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚足联球队世界杯战绩：日本淘汰！澳大利亚成唯一独苗，将战埃及</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b8c970abf_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b8c970abf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42b8c970abf.jpg"> </div><p>巴西2-1淘汰日本，本届世界杯亚足联球队只剩澳大利亚还未出局。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c4558cabbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">only one！巴西是历史上唯一一支世界杯全部23届都晋级16强的球队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.35" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42bbca063a8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.35" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.35" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42bbca063a8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42bbca063a8.jpg"> </div><p>巴西2-1绝杀逆转日本，是历史上唯一一支在全部23次参加世界杯都始终能够晋级16强的球队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42aca67cd56native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">身价4000万欧！25岁佐野海舟效力于德甲美因茨，上赛季48场2球4助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300134594306.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300134594306.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300134594306.jpg"> </div><p>巴西vs日本，佐野海舟一条龙破门。佐野海舟身价4000万欧，上赛季他在美因茨各项赛事出战48场贡献2球4助。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c3de982b1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭巴西绝杀！森保一：很遗憾结束本届世界杯，我们会继续努力变强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c3f8ca1f0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c3f8ca1f0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c3f8ca1f0.jpg"> </div><p>日本1-2负于巴西，止步32强。赛后日本主帅森保一接受了采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c6228ebe9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">森保一：球员们已经全力以赴了，是我的水平不够，向大家说声抱歉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c652349d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c652349d5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/6a42c652349d5.jpg"> </div><p>日本主帅森保一赛后接受了采访，谈到了球队失利等话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c9f56e511native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">森保一：只要以世界第一为目标并努力下去，日本足球一定能做到</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-30/6a42c055de356native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">见惯大场面！马丁内利绝杀巴西全队疯狂庆祝，安切洛蒂非常淡定！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.85" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260630/202606300259245132.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.du